{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21697","headline":"酬乐天得微之诗知通州事因成四首 三 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天得微之诗知通州事因成四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"哭鸟昼飞人少见，伥魂夜啸虎行多。\n满身沙虱无防处，独脚山魈不奈何。\n甘受鬼神侵骨髓，常忧岐路处风波。\n南歌未有东西分，敢唱沧浪一字歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}